where hth_tht is the hidden state at time t, xtx_txt is the input at time t, h(t1)h_{(t-1)}h(t1) is the hidden state of the layer at time t-1 or the initial hidden state at time 0, and rtr_trt, ztz_tzt, ntn_tnt are the reset, update, and new gates, respectively. \sigma is the sigmoid function, and \odot is the Hadamard product.
